-- SEGMENT ADJACENCY (the line graph pgRouting routes on)
-- Every ordered pair of segments meeting at a junction, both directions,
-- turn cost by the post-seed C2 formula: roundabout 15 s, straight on
-- (deflection <= 30 deg) 3 s, signalised turn 12 s, other turn 10 s.  A
-- movement at a junction 16+ cites the NEAREST seeded junction as a
-- placeholder (junctions 16+ do not exist yet when this file loads):
-- reanchor_osm_network.sql writes it at its own junction.  One-way segments
-- are listed with their physical movements: the directed corridor.road_graph
-- view (012) enters them only at their start and leaves only at their end.
